{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e07-scene-16",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "原来这就是一手遮天  (What Wielding Power Really Costs)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "qin_xiao": "秦箫"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Following Chun Yuqiao from a distance after asking why he promoted her, Bu Xiaogu finds him doubled over on the pavement in acute pain and rushes him to hospital before Qin Xiao phones to check on her. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，你先坐一会儿！你别动，快醒醒啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这样不行，我马上给您叫救护车！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不用叫救护车。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那你先把胃药吃了，我去路边拦车，你坐好等我啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐不接我电话，其他人我也找不着。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，雷总通知我调职了，为什么之前您不调我，现在又调用我？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "之前时机不行，现在可以了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "同事们都说您现在一手遮天了，看来是真的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "是，你懂什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "原来同事口中的一手遮天是这样的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "小谷，我的会议刚结束，你今天怎么样啊？我现在去找你好不好？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我今天挺好的，秦箫，我跟你说，我爱上了一个人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "很多事要打开眼界才看得明白，一个人要花很多时间才能看懂，我爱上他了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，你先坐一会儿！你别动，快醒醒啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Chun Yuqiao, sit down for a moment! Do not move — stay awake!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这样不行，我马上给您叫救护车！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This will not do; I am calling an ambulance for you right now!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不用叫救护车。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No need for an ambulance.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那你先把胃药吃了，我去路边拦车，你坐好等我啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then take your stomach medicine first while I hail a cab by the road — sit tight and wait for me!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐不接我电话，其他人我也找不着。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingzi is not picking up my call, and I cannot reach anyone else either.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，雷总通知我调职了，为什么之前您不调我，现在又调用我？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Chun Yuqiao, Director Lei told me about my transfer; why did you not transfer me earlier, yet call on me now?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "之前时机不行，现在可以了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The timing did not allow it before; now it does.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "同事们都说您现在一手遮天了，看来是真的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Colleagues all say you wield total power at the company now, and it looks true.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "是，你懂什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes — what do you know about it?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "原来同事口中的一手遮天是这样的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So this is what wielding total power really looks like behind closed doors.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "小谷，我的会议刚结束，你今天怎么样啊？我现在去找你好不好？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, my event just wrapped up — how was your day? Shall I come meet you now?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我今天挺好的，秦箫，我跟你说，我爱上了一个人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am alright today, Qin Xiao; let me tell you something — I have fallen in love with someone.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "很多事要打开眼界才看得明白，一个人要花很多时间才能看懂，我爱上他了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Many things take broader horizons to see clearly, and a person takes time to truly understand — I love him.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，你先坐一会儿！你别动，快醒醒啊！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这样不行，我马上给您叫救护车！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不用叫救护车。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那你先把胃药吃了，我去路边拦车，你坐好等我啊！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐不接我电话，其他人我也找不着。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，雷总通知我调职了，为什么之前您不调我，现在又调用我？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "之前时机不行，现在可以了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "同事们都说您现在一手遮天了，看来是真的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "是，你懂什么？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "原来同事口中的一手遮天是这样的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "小谷，我的会议刚结束，你今天怎么样啊？我现在去找你好不好？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我今天挺好的，秦箫，我跟你说，我爱上了一个人。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "很多事要打开眼界才看得明白，一个人要花很多时间才能看懂，我爱上他了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Having witnessed the heavy personal price Yuqiao pays behind the scenes, Xiaogu realises she has fallen deeply in love with him. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "明天见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
